  "fullDescription": "***42 Forest Deer Procreate Brush Stamp Set***\n\nSet of 42 Forest Deer Silhouette Stamp Brushes. This set includes 30 deer stamps (standing, grazing) and 12 nature element stamps (grass, trees, leaves), featuring hand-drawn designs. You can use them for a variety of projects such as banners, stickers, cards, labels, sublimation graphics, and more.\n\nThe brushes can be adjusted in size, color, and opacity.\n\nThis brush set can only be used with the Procreate app on iPad.\n\nYou will get:\n– 42 Forest Deer Procreate Brush Stamp Set (.brushset) (included in the zip file)\n\nRequirements:\n• iPad\n• Apple Pencil or stylus pen compatible with iPad\n• Procreate app (version 5.0 or higher)\n\nHow to use: Just download the file and unzip it. Tap once on the .brushset file, and the brushes will automatically import to Procreate.\n\nIf you like my product, please leave a comment and follow the store to get notified when new products are available. Thank you very much!",
